    "caption": "📣 Attention to all startups interested in entering the market of Qatar.\n\n⚡️ Astana Hub invites you to the webinar “Funding Opportunities in Qatar’s Ecosystem.”\n\n🗣️ Our speaker-Allan Villegas, a serial entrepreneur and investor who has dedicated himself to studying, practicing, and teaching entrepreneurship for the past ten years, will discuss the nuances of attracting investments in Qatar, the key players, and opportunities for Kazakh startups to secure funding.\n\nThis webinar is organized with the support of the Astana Hub International Agent in Qatar - Assel Yergaziyeva. \n\nSave the date! \n\n⏰ Date: May 16th, 17:00.\n\n❗️ Register via the link in the bio. See you there!",
